      "act_id": "act1_inspect_central_token_deadly_backlash",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "jiang_qinghuang",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[calmly] [hoarsely] 这枚中枢令连着东华辖区的监天子网，底层嵌有仙庭的反噬死咒。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
