      "act_id": "act1_inspect_central_token_deadly_backlash",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "jiang_qinghuang",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[coldly] 一旦中枢令被外力强行毁去，子网会在三息之内向那三千座世界同时下达灭界清洗令，引爆所有高阶修士体内的母锁暗门。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "姜清凰指尖剑意点出三千界灭界清洗暗门"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c008_nar_p013",
      "act_id": "act1_inspect_central_token_deadly_backlash",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[dramatically] 陆烬眸光微凝，神识顺着她剑尖所指的那道隐蔽回流符纹探入三分。果然，在令牌核心最深处，盘踞着一团与当年大苍血月母坛同源、却精密了百倍的毁灭阵纹。只要令牌崩碎而未输入更高权限的指令，三千座世界的母碑就会像当年太虚画壁界的坍塌丹炉一样，将整座牧场的亿万生灵一并陪葬。",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "vast_hall",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
