      "act_id": "act1_inspect_central_token_deadly_backlash",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "lu_qingcang",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[angry] [hoarsely] 那这玩意儿岂不是成了烫手山芋，砸也砸不得，留着又替那帮畜生抽血？",
